Scenario: Download customer large files as employee
	Employee users should be able to download large attached files uploaded by a customer

	Given I generate a provisioning project name
	And I create a user with the following parameters
	| Screen Name   | lfa.customer1                       |
	| Email Address | lfa.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | LFA                                 |
	| Last Name     | Customer1                           |
